{'symbol': 'GL', 'date': '2022-06-20 16:36:00', 'title': 'GLOBE LIFE HELPS MAKE TOMORROW BETTER FOR LEND A HAND BAHAMAS', 'text': "MCKINNEY, TEXAS , JUNE 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLOBE LIFE LIBERTY NATIONAL DIVISION RAISED $66,036 AS PART OF THEIR INAUGURAL MAKE TOMORROW BETTER AWARD COMPETITION, WITH ALL PROCEEDS GOING TO LEND A HAND BAHAMAS. THE COMPETITION, WHICH RAN THROUGHOUT MAY 2022, CHALLENGED LIBERTY NATIONAL DIVISION AGENCY OWNERS TO DRIVE DONATIONS, CULMINATING IN THE FINAL AMOUNT BEING PRESENTED ON JUNE 3 AT THE COMPANY'S ANNUAL CONVENTION IN NASSAU, BAHAMAS."}